<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin, Yeni Parti U\u015fak \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na Adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131","articleSection":"Man\u015fet","dateCreated":"2026-10-09T11:45:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-09T11:45:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-09T12:13:06+03:00","wordCount":299,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.usakhabergazetesi.com.tr\/serap-ergun-bitgin-yeni-parti-usak-il-baskanligina-adayligini-acikladi"},"articleBody":"U\u015fak'ta Yeni Parti'nin il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 s\u00fcrecine ili\u015fkin yeni bir geli\u015fme ya\u015fand\u0131. Partinin U\u015fak Kurucu \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin, yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 yaz\u0131l\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131klamayla il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kamuoyuna duyurdu. Bitgin, U\u015fak'\u0131n sorunlar\u0131na \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00fcretmeyi ve vatanda\u015flarla do\u011frudan ileti\u015fim kurmay\u0131 esas alan bir siyasi anlay\u0131\u015fla hareket edeceklerini ifade etti.\r\n\r\nA\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131na U\u015fakl\u0131 vatanda\u015flara seslenerek ba\u015flayan Bitgin, kentin gelece\u011fine y\u00f6nelik hedeflerini payla\u015f\u0131rken, siyasi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131nda birlik ve beraberli\u011fi \u00f6n planda tutacaklar\u0131n\u0131 belirtti. U\u015fak i\u00e7in yeni bir anlay\u0131\u015f ortaya koymak istediklerini dile getiren Bitgin, siyasetin ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 de\u011fil, toplumun farkl\u0131 kesimlerini bir araya getiren bir yap\u0131da olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011fini vurgulad\u0131.\r\n\r\nSerap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin, a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131nda, \u201cBizim siyaset anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131z; ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131ran de\u011fil birle\u015ftiren, sorunlar\u0131 g\u00f6rmezden gelen de\u011fil \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm \u00fcreten, halktan uzak de\u011fil halk\u0131n i\u00e7inde bir anlay\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u201d ifadelerini kulland\u0131. U\u015fak'\u0131n yaln\u0131zca kent merkezinden ibaret olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, il\u00e7elerin ve mahallelerin de siyasi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n \u00f6nemli bir par\u00e7as\u0131 olaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirten Bitgin, her vatanda\u015f\u0131n sorununu \u00f6nemseyen bir yakla\u015f\u0131m benimseyeceklerini kaydetti.\r\n\r\n\u0130l ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na aday olma gerek\u00e7esini de a\u00e7\u0131klayan Bitgin, U\u015fak'ta yeni bir umut ve g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc bir gelecek hedefiyle yola \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtti. Kentin her mahallesinde ve il\u00e7esinde vatanda\u015flarla bir araya gelerek \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131 s\u00fcrd\u00fcrmek istedi\u011fini ifade etti. Adayl\u0131k a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131n\u0131 \u201cBirlikte ba\u015faraca\u011f\u0131z, birlikte YEN\u0130 bir gelecek kuraca\u011f\u0131z. Yeni Parti, Yeni U\u015fak, Yeni Gelecek!\u201d s\u00f6zleriyle tamamlayan Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin, il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in aday oldu\u011funu resmen duyurdu.","description":"Yeni Parti U\u015fak Kurucu \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin, il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na aday oldu\u011funu duyurdu. U\u015fak'ta birle\u015ftirici ve \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm odakl\u0131 bir siyaset anlay\u0131\u015f\u0131yla\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/usakhabergazetesicomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/usakhabergazetesi-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/10\/yeni-parti-usak-il-baskanligina-adayligini-acikladi-111.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Serap Erg\u00fcn Bitgin, Yeni Parti U\u015fak \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131na Adayl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.usakhabergazetesi.com.tr\/#organization","name":"U\u015fak Haber Gazetesi","image":"https:\/\/usakhabergazetesicomtr.teimg.com\/usakhabergazetesi-com-tr\/uploads\/2024\/12\/logo-7.jpg","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/usakhabergazetesicomtr.teimg.com\/usakhabergazetesi-com-tr\/uploads\/2024\/12\/logo-7.jpg","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Haber Merkezi","url":"https:\/\/www.usakhabergazetesi.com.tr\/muhabir\/2\/haber-merkezi"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"YAVUZ KU\u015eDEM\u0130R","url":"https:\/\/www.usakhabergazetesi.com.tr\/muhabir\/169\/yavuz-kusdemir"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.usakhabergazetesi.com.tr\/#organization","name":"U\u015fak Haber Gazetesi","url":"https:\/\/www.usakhabergazetesi.com.tr"}}</script>


